  "_note": "AT24C64 / 24C64 8-Kbit (8192 x 8) serial I2C EEPROM, DIP-8 — pin-for-pin the AT24C02's package: A0/A1/A2 (pins 1-3, address straps, sampled electrically to form the bus address 0b1010|A2A1A0), GND (4), SDA (5), SCL (6), WP (7, write protect), VCC (8). It was already in BoardCanvas's DIP_CHIP_LABELS with no sidecar behind it, so all eight pins rendered stacked at the part origin (2026-08-20).",
